※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4261
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4261 LANG_MASK_SHAPE_NOT_ONE_RUN

※ A table has more than one dimension, and which of them would be the low bits
※ is a question with no one answer.  A row of it is one run: `⎕mask(t⟦0⟧)`.

let std := ⎕import("std")

@[startup]
fn main(init: std.Init) → u6:
    let t: bool⟦2,2⟧ = ⟦⟦true, false⟧, ⟦false, true⟧⟧ in ⎕static
    if ⎕mask(t) = 9u8: 0u6 else: 1u6
